nrsc5-studio (0.3.7-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Linux packaging debut. .deb and .rpm now built from the same Rust
    source tree as the Windows portable zip. No DSP/SDR behavior
    change versus 0.3.6 — packaging metadata, install scripts,
    AppStream metainfo, .desktop launcher, hicolor icons, manpage,
    and a first-launch missing-helper dialog.
  * End-user .deb builds are produced by cargo-deb against
    [package.metadata.deb] in Cargo.toml (see packaging/debian/README.md).

 -- LTCAshraven <LTCAshraven@users.noreply.github.com>  Sun, 24 May 2026 00:00:00 +0000

nrsc5-studio (0.3.6-1) UNRELEASED; urgency=medium

  * Initial Debian source package skeleton. Not yet uploaded to the
    Debian archive. End-user .deb builds are produced by cargo-deb
    against [package.metadata.deb] in Cargo.toml (see
    packaging/debian/README.md).

